# HOW PEOPLE BUILD. One block per style; a culture takes the style that fits the land it began in. This is the
# surface a model can write to: the engine checks each style when it reads it and refuses one that could not hold
# a person or a stair, and the gate walks through what comes out. Everything is cells of 0.5 m.
#
#   biomes   where this style belongs: ocean beach desert savanna grassland forest jungle taiga tundra snow swamp mountain
#   wall     stone|wood|leaf MATERIAL     what stone does it stand on the law: wood and leaf burn
#   roof     gable|hip|flat  stone|wood|leaf MATERIAL
#   floors   MIN MAX
#   storey   CELLS, floor included (at least 5: a door is 4 tall)
#   width    MIN MAX      depth MIN MAX    of a house
#   base     stone|piles CELLS MATERIAL    what the floor stands on, and how high
#   windows  EVERY        a window every so many cells, 0 for none
#   ring     MATERIAL     towns and cities of this people have a wall
#
# Materials: granite basalt slate sandstone soil sand clay chalk gravel plaster brick thatch tile timber char reed

style hearth_timber
  biomes grassland forest
  wall wood timber
  roof gable wood thatch
  floors 1 2
  storey 6
  width 13 20
  depth 12 18
  base stone 1 granite
  windows 4

style river_brick
  biomes savanna grassland beach
  wall stone brick
  roof gable stone tile
  floors 1 3
  storey 6
  width 12 19
  depth 13 20
  base stone 1 slate
  windows 3
  ring brick

style sand_court
  biomes desert savanna beach
  wall stone sandstone
  roof flat stone clay
  floors 1 2
  storey 6
  width 13 22
  depth 13 22
  base stone 1 sandstone
  windows 5
  ring sandstone

style north_hall
  biomes taiga tundra snow
  wall wood timber
  roof hip wood slate
  floors 1 1
  storey 7
  width 14 24
  depth 12 16
  base stone 2 granite
  windows 0

style fen_watch
  biomes swamp jungle
  wall wood reed
  roof hip leaf thatch
  floors 1 2
  storey 6
  width 12 17
  depth 13 17
  base piles 4 timber
  windows 3

style high_stone
  biomes mountain tundra taiga forest
  wall stone granite
  roof gable stone slate
  floors 2 3
  storey 6
  width 12 17
  depth 13 18
  base stone 1 basalt
  windows 5
  ring granite

style white_quarter
  biomes grassland forest jungle beach
  wall stone plaster
  roof hip stone tile
  floors 1 3
  storey 6
  width 12 18
  depth 13 19
  base stone 1 chalk
  windows 3
  ring chalk
